# docs/Data is ignored wholesale because it holds bulky teaching datasets
# (Spotify_Youtube.csv alone is 30 MB). The exceptions below are the small files
# the site actually serves to students from the Homeworks > Data & PDF Downloads
# page -- without them those links 404 on GitHub Pages.
/docs/Data/*
